<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπορθμ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carry over</i> or <i>across</i> a river or strait,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Acus.
				29J.
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>carry a message from one to another,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.4
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be ferried across</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1188.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			metaph., <i>transmit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῖς τὰ παρ᾽ ἀνθρώπων καὶ ἀνθρώποις
					τὰ παρὰ θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					202e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῆρον εἰς τοὺς ἐκγόνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.81c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ποταμόν,</span> of ferry-boats, <i>ply
				across</i> a river, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.205
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5.52
			</span></i>: abs., <i>cross over,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>.</div>
